            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">This SiC FET device is based on a unique â€˜cascodeâ€™ circuit&#xD;&#xA;configuration, in which a normally-on SiC JFET is co-packaged with a&#xD;&#xA;Si MOSFET to produce a normally-off SiC FET device.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
